# P54a (REVIEW e682d71): unit_s7_prim_cross over its own convert.lm2 that P0 refuses -- a hanging `bad:`
# (tests/unit_s7_tbl_unparsable_table.lm2): the P0 diagnostic is said, located in convert.lm2, and
# the use site adds nothing (it said only "cannot read the conversion table").

fn: go () int
    int: a 1
    size_t: b 2U
    a: b
    return: a

int: k
k: go()
if: k = 2
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 1; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
